    "detailed_description": "<h1>Upcoming Game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/223513de62addfd9eeb21a436ab5c539.avif?t=1753986109\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/e4bc8ffd792dfd909faf45b04610967f.avif?t=1753986109\" /></div><i>&quot;Is there a true path to happiness?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abruptly finding herself at the bottom of a snake pit, an impoverished girl named Linh is bound and helpless for a crime she did not commit. Left to the mercy of the village snake god, a mysterious entity appears before her, offering to save her in exchange for her soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding herself in a new reality, she is torn between staying with the beautiful temptress, Ai, who had rescued her from death, and the resourceful wanderer, Jinhai, who promises to set her free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is the real savior? Will Linh discover the strength to change her own fate? Journey with Linh as she is forced to question her understanding of life, happiness, and what it means to be human. Each decision matters in this tale about identity, friendship, love and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/cfed237ac166c2cb281c0d51c26af047.avif?t=1753986109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc0d Snake Goddess, a thousand years of wisdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcff Wanderer Nun, resourceful and handsome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d Friendships, deep ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 Romance, slow-burn and genuine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd14 Philosophy to ponder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude0b Food to feast on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Mermaids, Nagas, Snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe0 Found Family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0f Vietnam, Japan, China</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd1a Five Endings, none is bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270d\ufe0f Written by a female creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Extras: Music Player, CG Gallery, Character Profiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 Accessibility Options \u2013 Fonts, Song/SFX Captions, Self-Voicing</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/e4bc8ffd792dfd909faf45b04610967f.avif?t=1753986109\" /></div><i>&quot;Is there a true path to happiness?&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abruptly finding herself at the bottom of a snake pit, an impoverished girl named Linh is bound and helpless for a crime she did not commit. Left to the mercy of the village snake god, a mysterious entity appears before her, offering to save her in exchange for her soul. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finding herself in a new reality, she is torn between staying with the beautiful temptress, Ai, who had rescued her from death, and the resourceful wanderer, Jinhai, who promises to set her free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who is the real savior? Will Linh discover the strength to change her own fate? Journey with Linh as she is forced to question her understanding of life, happiness, and what it means to be human. Each decision matters in this tale about identity, friendship, love and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1121300/extras/cfed237ac166c2cb281c0d51c26af047.avif?t=1753986109\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc0d Snake Goddess, a thousand years of wisdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcff Wanderer Nun, resourceful and handsome</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd1d Friendships, deep ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25 Romance, slow-burn and genuine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd14 Philosophy to ponder</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude0b Food to feast on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddc\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Mermaids, Nagas, Snakes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfe0 Found Family</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0f Vietnam, Japan, China</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd1a Five Endings, none is bad!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270d\ufe0f Written by a female creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Original Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Extras: Music Player, CG Gallery, Character Profiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 Accessibility Options \u2013 Fonts, Song/SFX Captions, Self-Voicing</p>",
    "short_description": "Mizuchi \u767d\u86c7\u5fc3\u50b3 is a heartfelt and philosophical yuri visual novel inspired by the Legend of the White Snake and multiple folklores. Follow Linh's journey with a beautiful shape-shifting temptress and a resourceful warrior nun, and experience a story of friendship, love, transformation, and belonging.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cMizuchi takes its time building up the relationships between its female leads\u2026this is a game that is meant to be savored.\u201d<br>Blerdy Otome<br><br>\u201cThere are many layers of meaning, and it's nice to ponder them after playing...it will leave an imprint on my gamer heart. (translated)\u201d<br>JRPGFR<br><br>\u201cAn intriguing visual novel that\u2019s proven to be both unique and philosophical.\u201d<br>The Lily Garden<br>",
